	(4102, 'Joy Hossain', 'Name - Charge - 8/24/2024', '\n      <p style="">\n          <p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Summery:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Reporting officer (Joy Hossain) under LSPD department. I was patrolling with my car and suddenly I got a call on my phone. The call was from the bank manager. The bank manager told me that a number of people had broken into their bank lockers. Area (hawic avenue) responded to bank Robbery. On arrival we found that there were 2 robbers and 1 hostage. There was white car/Bike parked Infront of bank. LetÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s talk to Robbers and find out more (There are 02 insides, 01 outsides.)</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Demanding the release of their hostages &gt;&gt;</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&gt;&gt; Demand: Free Passage , No spike&nbsp;</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&gt;&gt; Commanding Officer:Joy Hossain</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&gt;&gt; Negotiation Officer: joy Hossain</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&gt;&gt; Hostage Name:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&gt;&gt; Gun Level: 1</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&gt;&gt; Registration Plate:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&gt;&gt; Car Model:</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&gt;&gt; Car Owner:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&gt;&gt;Jail:</span></p><p style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&gt;&gt;Fine:</span></p><p style="color: white;"><br></p>\n      </p>\n  ', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '1724518401635', 'police'),
