	(4154, 'Joy Hossain', 'FLEECA BANK- Charge - 8/28/2024', '\n      <p style="">\n          </p><p><span style="font-size: small; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong><u style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Reporting officer (Joy Hossain) under LSPD department. I was patrolling with my car and suddenly I got a call on my phone. The call was from the bank manager. The bank manager told me that a number of people had broken into their bank lockers. Area (LEGION SQUARE) responded to bank Robbery. On arrival we found that there were 2 robbers and 1 hostage. There was white car/Bike parked Infront of bank. LetÃƒÂ¢Ã¢â€šÂ¬Ã¢â€žÂ¢s talk to Robbers and find out more (There are 02 insides, 02 outsides.) Demanding the release of their hostages.</u></strong></span></p><p><span style="font-size: small; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong><u style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></u></strong></span></p><p><span style="font-size: small; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong><u style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&gt;&gt; Demand: Free Passage , No tease For 6 Second&nbsp;&nbsp;</u></strong></span></p><p><span style="font-size: small; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong><u style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&gt;&gt; Commanding Officer: JOY HOSSAIN</u></strong></span></p><p><span style="font-size: small; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong><u style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&gt;&gt; Negotiation Officer:&nbsp;</u></strong></span><strong style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: small;"><u style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">JOY HOSSAIN</u></strong></p><p><span style="font-size: small; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong><u style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&gt;&gt; Hostage Name:&nbsp; THE SOBUJ</u></strong></span></p><p><span style="font-size: small; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong><u style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&gt;&gt; Gun Level: 1</u></strong></