	(4198, 'Srikant Tiwari', 'Paleto Bank Robbery Charge - 9/4/2024', '<p>there was a code 90 situation going on Paleto Bank which has beed discover by Alice Cooper, after getting informed from alice cooper our officers respondfs the situation.</p><p>Hostage name itaci uchiha (told by hostage), he was not harmed by suspects(no medical support needed)</p><p>Robbers was 4 people (2 inside/ 2 outside). There gun level was 1.</p><p>Their demand was Free phasage and no Tease for 6 second outside from the vehichale.</p><p>Their escape vehichale was black Kuruma (LFM72746).</p><p>After reach the escape point the started gunshort to iniciate a Code Red situation.</p><p>Scene command - Alice cooper</p><p>Negotiation and HRT - Srikant Tiwari</p>', '[]', '["(304 | Alice Cooper) Alice Cooper","(402 | singham singh riot) Singham Singh Riot","(407 l Mr. Chacchu) MR  Chacchu","(458 | Bagha Robin) Bagha Robin","(454 I Srikant Tiwari) Srikant Tiwari"]', '[]', '[]', '1725403575739', 'police'),
