	(4221, 'IH ALPHA', 'Legion Bank Robbery - Charge - 9/23/2024', '\n      <p style="color: white;">\n          </p><p><strong>ÃƒÂ°Ã…Â¸Ã¢â‚¬Å“Ã‚Â Summary:&nbsp;</strong><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">A daring bank heist took place in  </span><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">fleeca bank</span><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">.  a group of two men entered the bank at around </span><strong><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">1</span><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">:40 a</span><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">.m</span></strong><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">.</span><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">, posing as customers</span><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">.The police were notified immediately</span><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">,</span></p><p><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">Police came to the crime scene and found that the robbers had completely messed up the bank</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font