px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">,</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">.The police accepted their demands and rescued the hostages</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">.</span></p><p style="color: white;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">The police started a chase to arrest  the robbers and at one point the robbers managed to escape</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-family: &quot;gg sans&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Symbols&quot;; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">.</span><font face="gg sans, Noto Sans, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Symbols"><br></font>\n          </p><p style="color: white;"><br></p><p style="color: white;"><font face="gg sans, Noto Sans, Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Symbols"><span style="white-space: break-spaces;">Scene command : laizypanda</span></font></p><p style="color: white;"><font face="gg sans, Noto Sans, H