	(4248, 'El Magico', '10-11 TO 10-72- Kidnapping a civilian - 10/21/2024', '\n      <p style="color: white;">\n          <p><strong>Ã°Å¸â€œÂ Summary:</strong></p>\n          <p><em>While I was performing code 1 near Legion, I saw a bike break two traffic rules: driving in the wrong lane and running a red light. I initiated a 10-11 and called for a 10-77, to which Officer Francesco Leo responded. While conducting the 10-11 on the BMW bike, a few people arrived in a car and stepped out holding class 3 weapons, attempting to kidnap me. I moved to their rear to avoid being gun-pointed, but instead, they took the passenger from the bike hostage.&nbsp;</em><em style="background-color: var(--color-1);">The driver of the bike then got off and switched to another car, starting a 10-80, with the hostage in the car. It\'s important to note that the driver was involved with the kidnappers. He later met up with the other kidnappers, and they took the victim. The driver once again initiated a 10-80. After a long chase, Officer Garp and I managed to block his car.&nbsp;</em><em style="background-color: var(--color-1);">I exited my vehicle, aiming my taser at him, but he fled and drew a class 3 weapon. I quickly holstered my taser and drew my firearm, attempting to take him down, but I was unsuccessful. In the end, Officer Garp managed to neutralize him.</em></p></p><p><em><br></em></p><p style="color: white;">\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>Ã°Å¸Â§Â Hostage:</strong> [Name Here]</p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>Ã°Å¸â€”â€žÃ¯Â¸Â Evidence Location:</strong> Stash # | Drawer #</p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>Ã°Å¸â€Âª Weapons/Items Confiscated:</strong></p>\n          <p><em>Ã‚Â· [Insert List Here]</em></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p>-----</p>\n          <p><strong style="background-color: var(--color-1);">Ã°Å¸â€™Â¸ Fine:</strong></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>Ã¢Å’Å¡ Sentence:</strong></p>\n       