	(4257, 'Harry Dexter', 'Ifrat - (Found guns) - 10/25/2024 ', '\n      <p style="color: white;">\n          <p><strong>Ã°Å¸â€œÂ Summary:</strong></p>\n          <p><em>[</em>Officer Mr. AK got a call from main garage EMS down call.He respond over there and there was a shots fired AK saw EMS got down. At that moment he saw that in main garage cyan color Two vehicle roaming around him. AK try to secure that down person. After few minutes later I got&nbsp; 77 call that those two cyan color cars block Officer Ak. Then those cyan colr people take out their guns and shot officers. At that time we were not enough officers. after secure that down EMS he told use to take him PD.We took him to the PD and try to talk to him. When I took him to the PD, I search him for security purpose I found&nbsp; 4 different class of weapons. When I asked how did he got it, he told us, he got from Tokiyo Manji. He was doing Songothon, he mentioned that. when we asked him about gun, he told us if we want to take those guns we can take it. After that we took it from him. When we asked about Tokiyo Manji, he said that he left that.<em>]</em></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;<br></p>\n          <p><strong>Ã°Å¸â€”â€žÃ¯Â¸Â Evidence Location:</strong> 4257# | Drawer #</p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>Ã°Å¸â€Âª Weapons/Items Confiscated:</strong></p>\n          <p><em>Ã‚Â· [GS-GC22-X: amount 2, Glock BEAM Switch:&nbsp;</em><em style="background-color: var(--color-1);">amount 1, White-out ARP</em><em style="background-color: var(--color-1);">]</em></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p>-----</p>\n          <p><strong style="background-color: var(--color-1);">Ã°Å¸â€™Â¸ Fine:</strong></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>Ã¢Å’Å¡ Sentence:</strong></p>\n          <p>----</p>\n      </p>\n  ', '[]', '["(301) Harry Dexter","(253 | Mr Ak) Mr Ak","(230 | Mohin Dewan) Mohin Dewan"]', '[]', '["https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1276213730895597680/1299669098451439696/Screensho