 style="background-color: var(--color-1);"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;">two robbers stand outside the main gate with class 1 weapon </span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;">. The police negotiate with the robbers to save the hostage</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;">. demand was  free passage and no spike.</span><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;">The police accepted their demands and rescued the hostages</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif;">.</span></span></p></span></span><span style="background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;"><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;">The police started a chase to arrest  the robbers and at one point the robbers managed to escape</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; background-color: var(--color-1); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;">.</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; background-color: var(--color-1);"> </span></p></span></p>\n          <p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong style=""><span style="font-family: Impact, Charcoal, sans-serif;">Ã°Å¸Â§Â</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, 