	(4271, 'Oreaa Masud', 'Paleto Bay - Bank - 11/2/2024', '\n      <p style="">\n          </p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>[DETAILS | DEMANDS]:</strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>During normal patrol, dispatch received a report of an alarm at the Paleto Bank. Once [CO] Commanding Officer was established, Officer <span style="background-color: rgb(84, 141, 212);">Oreaa Masud</span> was assigned to create an incident report.</strong></font></p><p style=""><strong style=""><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">After setting up the perimeter around the area, we began negotiations. During the talks, the 2 unidentified suspect(s) demanded </span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">FREE PASSAGE &amp; NO Tase For 6 Sec</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"> on the perimeter for the safety of the 1 hostage(s).</span></strong></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong><br></strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>Gateway Vehicle:&nbsp;</strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong><br></strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>[SCENE ASSIGNMENT]</strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>Scene Command : <span style="background-color: rgb(84, 141, 212);">Mr Ak</span></strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>Negotiator : <span style="background-color: rgb(84, 141, 212);">Panda</span></strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>Evidence Taken By : <span style="background-color: rgb(84, 141, 212);">Mufasa</span></strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>HRT :&nbsp;</strong></font><strong style="background-color: var(--color-1); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(84, 141, 212);">Panda</span></strong></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong><br></strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>[INVOLVED IN PURSUIT]:</strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>Primary Unit : Steve</strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>Secondary Unit : Ric</strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>Tertiary Unit : Mufasa</strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>Parallel Unit : Mr Ak</strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>Mobile Unit : N/A</strong></font></p><p style=""><font color="#ffffff"><strong>5th/Air1 : Magico , Masud</strong></font></p>\n      \n  ', '[]', '["(253 | Mr Ak) Mr Ak","(320) Laizy Panda","(321) MR MUFASA","(405 | Oreaa Masud) Oreaa Masud","(106 | Steve Johnson) Steve Johnson","(100) EnRic Cooper","(242) El Magico"]', '["Bagha Robin"]', '["https://files.catbox.moe/19vcy8.png"]', '1730489970784', 'police'),
	(4272, 'Bagha Robin', 'Little Soul - Shootouts - 11/3/2024', '\n      <p style="color: white;">\n          </p><p><strong>Ã°Å¸â€œÂ Summary:</strong></p>\n          <p><em>There was a civilian call for <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">10-71</span> in Little Soul. On arrival to Little Soul, there were shots on PD vehicles and Air-1. Air-1 managed to gather some evidence. After 1 hour EMS visited the same area to recover a patient, and they were under fire as well.</em></p><p><em>There has been multiple <span style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">10-71</span> calls from this specific area and a cluster of buildings over past few weeks. Multiple officers have been injured and multiple PD vehicles have been severely damaged including Air-1.</em></p><p><em>There are multiple evidence shots taken from the scene to properly construct a file. Similar unidentified familiar individuals have been spotted at the same location over the course of past few weeks. A proper investigation on the locality is to be requested.</em></p><p><em>-Summarised by Bagha Robin under call from LSPD Chief</em></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>Ã°Å¸Â§Â Hostage:</strong> Not Applicable</p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>Ã°Å¸â€”â€žÃ¯Â¸Â Location:</strong> Little Soul, Los Santos</p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>Ã°Å¸â€Âª Weapons/Items Confiscated:</strong></p>\n          <p><em>Ã‚Â· [Insert List Here]</em></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p>-----</p>\n          <p><strong style="background-color: var(--color-1);">Ã°Å¸â€™Â¸ Fine:</strong></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>Ã¢Å’Å¡ Sentence:</strong></p>\n          <p>-----</p><p><br></p>\n      \n  ', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '1730579034683', 'police'),
	(4273, 'Laizy Panda', 'Name -Flecca Bank Robbery Charge - 11/5/2024', '\n      <p style="">\n          </p><p style="color: white;"><strong>ðŸ“ Summary:</strong></p>\n          <p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">Scene command  </span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">: Mr. Ak</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">\n\nNegotiator </span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">: Mr. N.H Rana</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">\n\nMdt </span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">: Mr. panda</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">\n\nEvidence </span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">: Oreaa masud</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">\n\nHrt</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">/ Hru </span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px; white-space: break-spaces;">\n\n</span></span><