e police accepted their demands and rescued the hostages</span><span style="font-family: &quot;Arial Black&quot;, Gadget, sans-serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; outline: 0px;">.</span><em>]</em></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>🧍 Hostage:</strong> [Mr. Paitu]</p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>🗄️ Evidence Location:</strong> Stash # | Drawer #</p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>🔪 Weapons/Items Confiscated:</strong></p>\n          <p><em>· [Class-3]</em></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p>-----</p>\n          <p><strong style="background-color: var(--color-1);">💸 Fine:</strong></p>\n          <p>&nbsp;</p>\n          <p><strong>⌚ Sentence:</strong></p>\n          <p>-----</p>\n      \n  ', '[]', '["(320) Laizy Panda","(243) Mr Ak","(230 | Mohin Dewan) Mohin Dewan","(301) Harry Dexter","(200) Nh Rana"]', '["paitu paitu"]', '[]', '1732128126398', 'police');
